# `make gen`'s own PeakRDL output directory -- regenerated fresh from
# src/axi_qspi_regs.rdl every run, not itself a real source. The checked-in
# src/axi_qspi_regs_pkg.sv / src/axi_qspi_regs.sv are the real, canonical
# RTL (referenced by Bender.yml, used by every real build) and must be
# manually re-synced (copied) from here after editing the .rdl -- there is
# no automated copy-back step.
src/generated/
